          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "1. You design it",
            "text": "<p>Choose a ready-made favourite or build your own, bead by bead, sized to your wrist.</p>"
          }
        },
        "h2": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "2. I thread it by hand",
            "text": "<p>Every bracelet is made to order on strong cord with a secure clasp, so nothing sits in a warehouse.</p>"
          }
        },
        "h3": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "3. It's posted to you",
            "text": "<p>Wrapped in recyclable, plastic-free packaging and sent within 3 to 5 working days.</p>"
          }
        }
