    "about": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "cap": {
          "type": "caption",
          "settings": {
            "caption": "About me",
            "text_style": "caption-with-letter-spacing",
            "text_size": "medium"
          }
        },
        "head": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Hi, I'm [Name]",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I make colourful, made-to-order bracelets from my kitchen table, one bead at a time. It started as a way to switch off after work and turned into gifts for friends, then friends of friends.</p><p>Because I only make what's ordered, there's no excess stock and very little waste. If you have an idea that doesn't fit the builder, get in touch and we'll make it together.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
        "btn": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "Say hello",
            "button_link": "/#contact",
            "button_style_secondary": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "cap",
        "head",
        "text",
        "btn"
      ],
